       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TSTSETENV.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 TN-RESULT PIC S9(9) COMP-5.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 TN-NAME PIC X.
       01 TN-VALUE PIC X.
       01 TN-OVERWRITE PIC S9(9) COMP-5.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BY REFERENCE TN-NAME TN-VALUE
           TN-OVERWRITE.
           CALL "setenv" USING BY REFERENCE TN-NAME TN-VALUE
               BY VALUE TN-OVERWRITE RETURNING TN-RESULT
           GOBACK RETURNING TN-RESULT.
       END PROGRAM TSTSETENV.

