       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TSTENVCOMMAND.
       DATA DIVISION.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 TN-COMMAND PIC X(65536).
       01 TN-LENGTH PIC S9(9) COMP-5.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BY REFERENCE TN-COMMAND TN-LENGTH.
           MOVE SPACES TO TN-COMMAND
           MOVE 'if [ -z "${OPENAI_API_KEY+x}" ] && ' TO
               TN-COMMAND(1:35)
           MOVE '[ "$COBOLLM_SENTINEL" = keep ]; then ' TO
               TN-COMMAND(36:37)
           MOVE 'printf ENV-OK; else printf ENV-BAD; fi' TO
               TN-COMMAND(73:38)
           MOVE 110 TO TN-LENGTH
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM TSTENVCOMMAND.

