       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TSTPIPE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 TN-FILE-DESCRIPTORS.
           05 TN-PIPE-FD PIC S9(9) COMP-5 OCCURS 2 TIMES.
       01 TN-RESULT PIC S9(9) COMP-5.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 TN-READ-FD PIC S9(9) COMP-5.
       01 TN-WRITE-FD PIC S9(9) COMP-5.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BY REFERENCE TN-READ-FD TN-WRITE-FD.
           MOVE -1 TO TN-READ-FD TN-WRITE-FD
           CALL "pipe" USING BY REFERENCE TN-FILE-DESCRIPTORS
               RETURNING TN-RESULT
           IF TN-RESULT = ZERO
               MOVE TN-PIPE-FD(1) TO TN-READ-FD
               MOVE TN-PIPE-FD(2) TO TN-WRITE-FD
           END-IF
           GOBACK RETURNING TN-RESULT.
       END PROGRAM TSTPIPE.

